  questionText: 10. Who is reponsible to check the serviceability/accuracy of the
    altimeter?
  referenceImage: {fileID: 0}
  explanationText: "The Pilot-in-command is responsible for ensuring the aircraft\u2019s
    altimeter is serviceable and correctly functioning before flight. This includes
